Excluded data (documented provenance decisions)
------------------------------------------------------------
* Primus-Instruct: responses generated by GPT-4o (distilled from a proprietary model); excluded for provenance.
* Primus-Reasoning: reasoning generated by o1-preview; excluded for provenance.
* Glint-Research/Fable-5-traces: captured Claude Fable outputs; excluded for provenance (violates upstream terms).

The from-scratch track (darknode_ai.model) is trained from random
initialization by Darknode and carries no upstream model attribution.
